xmodel/sol-approaches.log:14233:+- **Cheapest untried experiment — 7/10.** Encode *both* coordinate fibrations, all infinity contacts, and the Jacobian pairing as one finite branch-cycle CSP for the (mu=6) residue-A data. This is more discriminating than enumerating another single-cover passport.
