The repository’s own shortlist confirms the experiment precisely. One important issue surfaced immediately: the phrase “polar residues” is not canonical for a higher-order meromorphic 1-form on a surface, so I’m testing several invariant candidates separately (curve residue after restriction, logarithmic coefficient along a divisor, and action periods) to avoid manufacturing an obstruction from coordinates.
