368-- **Campaign:** **Partial.** The coefficient templates, residue-A systems, finite-field probes, and Witt searches are structured searches, but there has been no systematic boundary-first plane collision search coupled to the currently minimal live $\mu=6$ data. Dense raw systems already reach hundreds to thousands of variables and OOM.
